  "description": "FlowT is a high-performance orchestration library for .NET that implements the Chain of Responsibility pattern with a fluent API. Build maintainable, testable pipelines with specifications, policies, and handlers. Features: Type-safe flows, Named keys for context storage, ValueTask optimization, 9-10x faster than MediatR with 76-84% fewer allocations.",
